  "wellbeing.checkin.title": "你好吗，园丁？",
  "wellbeing.checkin.mood_label": "你现在感觉如何？",
  "wellbeing.checkin.note_label": "今天园地中的一件事（可选）",
  "wellbeing.checkin.note_placeholder": "第一颗草莓。罗勒的香气。一只蜜蜂在洋甘菊上。",
  "wellbeing.checkin.save": "保存今天的记录",
